        "id": "p1",
        "order": 1,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s1",
            "text": "Companies are making a new type of car."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "text": "These cars drive themselves."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "order": 2,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "text": "In some ways, these cars will be great."
          },
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "text": "People won’t have to drive their cars."
          },
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "text": "So they can work or relax."
          },
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "text": "Also, this kind of vehicle will be safe."
          },
          {
            "id": "s7",
            "text": "A computer watches the road"
          },
          {
            "id": "s8",
            "text": "and prevents problems."
          },
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "It senses other cars and keeps a safe distance."
          },
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "This will mean fewer crashes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "order": 3,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "Not everyone likes these cars, though."
          },
          {
            "id": "s12",
            "text": "Some people don’t trust a car with no driver."
          },
          {
            "id": "s13",
            "text": "They think computers can make mistakes."
          },
          {
            "id": "s14",
            "text": "And some people just enjoy driving."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
